<title>USA: TABLE-New World Coffee Q2 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE-New World Coffee Q2 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						 6/29/97	    6/30/96</p>
<p> Revenues				     $4,019	     $2,629</p>
<p> Net Loss					(850)	    (2,597)</p>
<p> Net Loss Per Share			 (0.12)	     (0.56)</p>
